# Source Code

This directory contains the source code of Human4Human.

## Guidelines

* Organize code into modules with clear responsibilities.
* Keep business logic separate from infrastructure concerns where practical.
* Follow the project's agreed coding conventions.
* Add or update tests when changing behavior.
* Document non-obvious implementation choices.
* Avoid committing secrets, credentials, or environment-specific configuration.

The internal structure will evolve as the application architecture and technology stack are defined.
